compromise.body:
To the owner of the site(s) below,

While examining a fraud or phishing operation we found pages on your site(s) that appear to have been placed there by someone else. We believe your site is a victim, not the operator.

Site(s):
{subjects}

Evidence (capture time and SHA-256 of the stored record):
{evidence}

We recommend that you remove the injected pages, review accounts and credentials for the site, its hosting panel and its DNS, and check for further changes. We are not asking anyone to take your site down.

Our reference: {case}
